# techFEST '26 Operations - Environment Variables
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit that file.

# ---- Neon PostgreSQL (optional) ----
# Without this the panel still works: call logs, audit entries, password hashes
# and record overrides fall back to localStorage on the current device only.
#
# A VITE_* value is inlined into the browser bundle at build time, so treat it as
# visible to anyone who opens the site. For a publicly reachable deployment,
# prefer leaving this empty, or rotate the credential if the site is ever exposed.
VITE_NEON_DATABASE_URL=

# ---- CI only (GitHub Actions secrets, NOT .env.local) ----
# These must never be bundled. Configure them under
# Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions:
#   ADMIN_API_KEY      x-api-key for https://app.techfest26.com/api/admin/payments
#   NEON_DATABASE_URL  Postgres connection string used by the reconciliation job